EO:11987,EO:13112,99-3184,Presidential Document,1999-02-08,64 FR 6183,revocation,ending,True,False,False,True,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1999/02/08/99-3184.txt,34936137dac2284b58b8cbbe9dba9823e8fccd9119b2321176ec6fd12d017e04,"(b) Executive Order 11987 of May 24, 1977, is hereby revoked."
