EO:11989,FRDOC:05-22024,05-22024,Rule,2005-11-09,70 FR 68264,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,15,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2005/11/09/05-22024.txt,4dd8d1ec2aa4c3c782840d45926fe6798206185808b043f7726644bec21c84ec,The final rule is consistent with provisions of Executive Order 11644 and Executive Order 11989 regarding off-road use of motor vehicles on Federal lands.
