EO:12065,FRDOC:06-730,06-730,Proposed Rule,2006-01-26,71 FR 4332,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2006/01/26/06-730.txt,136ef9d2cec9d1c03cf4a6ab82ba4ea5d5267378af2c1befa1c1f79d4f6459a1,"(15) Services rendered in response to requests for classification review of DoD classified records, submitted under Executive Order 12065, ``National Security Information,'' and implemented by DoD 5200.1-R. Such services consist of the work performed in conducting the classification review or in granting and completing an appeal from a denial of declassification following such review."
