EO:12250,FRDOC:2026-04452,2026-04452,Rule,2026-03-06,91 FR 10955,restoration,ending,True,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2026/03/06/2026-04452.txt,8c36c47fa6fb369a3ba06e28a115508e6dac207f36a0919c0ba3508bf8ae837a,"In this document, DOE is further extending the effective date in order to follow the Department of Justice direction on the topic of the direct final rule under Executive Order 14281, ``Restoring Equality of Opportunity and Meritocracy'' and Executive Order 12250, ``Leadership and Coordination of Nondiscrimination Laws.'' 90 FR 17537 (April 28, 2025); 45 FR 72995 (Nov. 4, 1980)."
