EO:12924,FRDOC:00-20178,00-20178,Presidential Document,2000-08-08,65 FR 48347,continuation,continuing,True,False,False,,2,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2000/08/08/00-20178.txt,3cfccb8bd1d6c28c1bfaaeddfe6c4130bdd539c1b278ff93c2a7d6ee7f063d4f,"Therefore, in accordance with section 202(d) of the National Emergencies Act (50 U.S.C. 1622(d)), I am continuing the national emergency declared in Executive Order 12924."
