EO:12928,FRDOC:2026-12560,2026-12560,Proposed Rule,2026-06-23,91 FR 37636,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,True,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2026/06/23/2026-12560.txt,7f31f9e7b84e7e14fca8bc238cae0d255bf06befa8d974a50345c4d8556b73ce,"(a) As established in Executive Order 12928 of September 16, 1994, Promoting Procurement With Small Businesses Owned and Controlled By Socially and Economically Disadvantaged Individuals, Historically Black Colleges and Universities, and Minority Institutions, agencies should promote participation of Historically Black Colleges and Universities and Minority Institutions in Federal procurement."
