EO:12931,FRDOC:94-29980,94-29980,Uncategorized Document,1994-12-06,,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1994/12/06/94-29980.txt,6a95038e67a0a0f1ec89d9bfb7a96ef3cfa4b0beebbf1758ef3e51c8d4ddf816,"By virtue of the authority vested in me by Department of State Delegation of authority No. 120-4 (59 FR 38022-38023) and in order to implement the Office of Federal Procurement Policy Act (41 U.S.C. 414) and Executive Order 12931, it is directed as follows:"
EO:12931,FRDOC:95-18105,95-18105,Rule,1995-07-24,60 FR 37930,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,3,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1995/07/24/95-18105.txt,e870cbd1a8f4da8d9b5c81aae04f293727e209615564afe9321ad3b5180c4d71,"FTA found this waiver to be in the public interest because it simplifies government procedures and streamlines government procurement requirements, consistent with the President's National Performance Review, Executive Order 12931 (Federal Procurement Reform), and the Federal Acquisition Streamlining Act of 1994 (FASA), Public Law 103- 355, 108 Stat. 3243 (October 13, 1994)."
EO:12931,FRDOC:95-6386,95-6386,Proposed Rule,1995-03-15,60 FR 14178,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,True,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1995/03/15/95-6386.txt,17c3bd3c89328dea20d7fe02a394c4c7b8b0b6a7c7e983597afb88944f0370bb,"The first is Executive Order 12931 of October 13, 1994, Federal Procurement Reform, which requires that Federal agencies review their procurement requirements with a view to streamlining them."
EO:12931,FRDOC:95-6387,95-6387,Rule,1995-03-15,60 FR 14174,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,True,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1995/03/15/95-6387.txt,8fee2e81c525db9cae618dc335d69d0237bfa50fd5693ead7847c9ba0affd449,"The first is Executive Order 12931 of October 13, 1994, Federal Procurement Reform, which requires that Federal agencies review their procurement requirements with a view to streamlining them."
EO:12931,FRDOC:96-12341,96-12341,Rule,1996-05-17,61 FR 25088,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1996/05/17/96-12341.txt,30ed12090ff47dc3523b38944227cae98574710797a0ee9b7edad63d94ecd643,"The NPRM pointed out that this proposal is consistent with several recent initiatives, including the President's National Performance Review, Executive Order 12931 (Federal Procurement Reform), and the Federal Acquisition Streamlining Act of 1994 (FASA) (Pub. L. 103-355, 108 Stat. 3243 (October 13, 1994)), which direct Federal agencies to remove administrative burdens in procurement processes."
EO:12931,FRDOC:96-1830,96-1830,Proposed Rule,1996-01-31,61 FR 3532,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1996/01/31/96-1830.txt,2b336091a5a792d9c2c0480c046692383e787ba50a7f94cb21ff145467c3efe2,"This proposal is consistent with several recent initiatives, including the President's National Performance Review, Executive Order 12931 (Federal Procurement Reform), and the Federal Acquisition Streamlining Act of 1994 (FASA) (Pub. L. 103-355, 108 Stat. 3243 (October 13, 1994)), which direct Federal agencies to remove administrative burdens in procurement processes."
EO:12931,FRDOC:E8-8917,E8-8917,Notice,2008-04-24,73 FR 22125,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2008/04/24/E8-8917.txt,07f959ddfb5dbeabd64ce062b11d695aa6520f3eeeac6bbeb28883ee96a14604,"SUPPLEMENTARY INFORMATION: Pursuant to the Executive Order 12931, Federal Procurement Reform, which directed effective and efficient spending of public funds through fundamental reforms in Government procurement, USDA has developed and implemented a new system of records designated as the USDA Integrated Acquisition System (IAS)."
