EO:13011,FRDOC:00-4512,00-4512,Notice,2000-02-25,65 FR 10049,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2000/02/25/00-4512.txt,a534afda32022d411b0caba867a390955cd7a5515ba59d97c9db447fc90b308e,"The Information Technology Management Reform Act of 1996 (Division E of Public Law 104-106) and Executive Order 13011 signed by the President emphasize agency management of information technology and Government-wide interagency support activities to improve productivity, security, interoperability, and coordination of Government resources."
