EO:13129,EO:13268,02-16951,Presidential Document,2002-07-03,67 FR 44751,revocation,ending,True,False,False,True,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2002/07/03/02-16951.txt,5cc6521b272d81090684fecd6900f53d6bf032bfac59bc62ac8dbe6ecbc7b3f5,"I, GEORGE W. BUSH, President of the United States of America, find that the situation that gave rise to the declaration of a national emergency in Executive Order 13129 of July 4, 1999, with respect to the Taliban, in allowing territory under its control in Afghanistan to be used as a safe haven and base of operations for Usama bin Ladin and the Al-Qaida organization, has been significantly altere"
