EO:13693,FRDOC:2015-23246,2015-23246,Notice,2015-09-16,80 FR 55628,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2015/09/16/2015-23246.txt,c0f7259df7a480f76b57bb208c953d2ea39486abe30a0254ab2fb32e1716f39a,"Hackathon projects may include the following: <bullet> Green House Gas (GHG) Reduction Visualization--The Office of Governmentwide Policy (OGP) has been working to create an analytical framework and tool to support agencies in meeting the goals outlined in a recent Executive Order 13693 `Planning for Federal Sustainability in the Next Decade', regarding greenhouse gas emission reductions."
