EO:13843,FRDOC:2024-01337,2024-01337,Rule,2024-01-30,89 FR 5737,modification,modifying,True,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2024/01/30/2024-01337.txt,063ccb68a1b08392b619ad25528ec04c950788c7c70e36626dd1f7a67154a52e,"OPM also proposed minor revisions to reflect changes resulting from Executive Order 13843 ``Excepting Administrative Law Judges from the Competitive Service,'' signed July 10, 2018.\22\ For example, OPM proposed to modify the language of Sec. 930.202 to remove the reference to a ``certificate of eligibles'' to reflect that ALJ positions are now excepted service. -----------------------------------"
