EO:14023,FRDOC:2021-23944,2021-23944,Notice,2021-11-03,86 FR 60632,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,3,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2021/11/03/2021-23944.txt,4933aa1eec39d0a24fb3466d13303772e34c8e442c340cff4cac70df0c574a91,"Further, GSA is providing notice of an open public virtual meeting of the Commission in accordance with the requirements of the Federal Advisory Committee Act. The purpose of this meeting is for the Commissioners to vote on amended by-laws and deliberate on revised discussion materials that will inform the report the Commission is charged with preparing pursuant to Executive Order 14023."
