EO:14110,FRDOC:2024-29354,2024-29354,Rule,2024-12-18,89 FR 103054,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,19,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2024/12/18/2024-29354.txt,1b151d689037a5ecfddc329161403c3a531fe4900e0f4108fdf669b34086ee30,"As explained further below, DHS disagrees that requiring a direct relationship between the required degree field(s), or their equivalents, and the duties of the position is inconsistent with E.O. 14110 or creates additional hurdles for foreign nationals seeking to work in AI or other science, technology, engineering, and math (STEM) fields."
