EO:14247,FRDOC:2026-08278,2026-08278,Proposed Rule,2026-04-29,91 FR 23039,amendment,modifying,True,False,False,,6,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2026/04/29/2026-08278.txt,656773be37facd6d59fc25a5ba4369c5b84ee9b1b5b092e7ecb141cceebc0024,"While this waiver can currently be used by an agency without prior Treasury approval, Fiscal Service believes that amending part 208 to require agencies to seek approval to issue check payments for non-regular and non-recurring payments (including classes of such payments) would meaningfully support the administration's goal, as set forth in E.O. 14247, to eliminate paper-based transactions."
